# RENDERED / CLONED AUDIO — never commit the actual audio files (Robert 2026-09-02).
# They are heavy binaries; deliver mp3s through the app (SendUserFile), keep them on disk, out of git.
# (Already-tracked reference clips in lab/cast/voices/*.wav stay tracked - a gitignore rule does not untrack them - so the voice LOCK is preserved.)
*.mp3
*.wav
*.m4a
*.ogg
*.webm
*.flac
lab/cast/voices/candidates/*.wav
lab/cast/voices/candidates/*.mp3

# CHARACTER PORTRAIT RENDERS (Robert 2026-09-02) — regenerate from lab/cast/images/portraits.json via
# gen_portraits_krea.mjs (cupcake Krea). Heavy binaries, kept on disk, out of git like the audio.
lab/cast/images/*.png
lab/cast/images/*.jpg
lab/cast/images/sheets/
